# Secrets, testing, and docs

- Do **not** hardcode secrets; use env / `.env.example` patterns per project docs.
- After substantive changes, run the **smallest relevant** automated check (`pytest`, targeted scripts, `pre-commit` before push when applicable).
- When behaviors or setup change, update existing docs (e.g. `README.md`, `BUILD_TIMELINE.md`, contracts) rather than orphan summaries.

See [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Quick Triggers and Agent Etiquette.
